gns and her left eye winking, she blinks slowly, her shoulders rising and falling with a soft breath, strands of hair swaying gently in the breeze, frills on her sleeves rustling softly.\n\n[1.0s-3.0s] Suddenly noticing the viewer, she lights up with excitement, leaning her upper body forward eagerly. Her left hand drops from the peace sign, moving down toward her chest, while her right hand stays up. The bright, energetic young woman with a high-pitched genki voice (S1) exclaims happily: <d>[Japanese] ねえねえ、見て見て！</d> Her eyes sparkling with enthusiasm, her smile widening into an excited grin.\n\n[3.0s-5.0s] She brings her left hand up to her cheek, forming a cute heart shape with her fingers against her face, tilting her head proudly to one side. She continues in a playful, boastful tone: <d>[Japanese] 可愛いでしょ？</d> Her eyes crinkle with delight as she shows off her pose, swaying slightly from side to side with pride.\n\n[5.0s-6.5s] Then she laughs brightly, pulling her left hand back up into a peace sign again, both hands forming double V signs near her face as she leans back just a little, beaming with the happiest expression: <d>[Japanese] えへへっ！</d> Her shoulders bouncing with cheerful laughter.\n\n[6.5s-8.0s] She holds the double peace sign pose with a radiant smile, winking her right eye playfully at the viewer, her hair continuing to drift and petals floating around her, breathing steadily as the video ends on that bright expression.\n\noverall_soundscape: soft rustle of fabric and hair from movement, gentle breeze, playful energetic atmosphere\nnon_diegetic_music: upbeat ukulele and xylophone melody at a bouncy tempo, light percussion accents, cheerful and energetic pop vibe that peaks in the middle then settles warmly\n", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 241, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 242, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "li